{
    "title": "Baby Panda's House Games",
    "description": "Baby Panda's Game House is a super application. You can find all your kids' favorite 3D BabyBus games (Ice Cream, School Bus, Policeman, etc.) Here. Come and explore this infinite 3D gaming space!\r\n\r\nROLE PLAY\r\nIn the game house, you can play a variety of roles! Become a doctor, a police officer, a makeup artist, a farmer, a fireman, or an ice cream maker! Experience the daily life of all professions in this virtual 3D game world. Create your own exciting story!\r\n\r\nDRIVING SIMULATION\r\nYou can also drive your car to different cities for adventure. There are a total of 22 vehicles for you to choose from, including school buses, police cars, fire trucks and more. Explore a variety of thrilling scenes and perform fun but complex tasks. Enjoy car driving!\r\n\r\nEDUCATIONAL MINI-GAMES\r\nThere are all kinds of educational games: maze, finding bunnies, fruit cutting, surfing at sea and more. Would you like to challenge them? It will not only test your reflexes, but also improve your logical thinking. Are you ready? Enter the game house and challenge now !\r\n\r\nBaby Panda's Game House is full of fun! No matter what kind of 3D games you like, the game House can stimulate your infinite potential. Join us now and explore this fantastic game house!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- A game house for children;\r\n- 38 3D games that kids love;\r\n- Play 17 roles in real life;\r\n- Numerous thrilling scenes to explore;\r\n- Multiple new games will be added;\r\n- Kid-friendly: free to switch mini-games;\r\n- Supports offline play!\r\n\r\nAbout BabyBus\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nAt BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids' creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids' perspective to help them explore the world on their own.\r\n\r\nNow BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children's apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\r\nContact us: ser@babybus.com\r\nVisit us: http://www.babybus.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Baby Panda&#39;s Game House is a super application. You can find all your kids&#39; favorite 3D BabyBus games (Ice Cream, School Bus, Policeman, etc.) Here. Come and explore this infinite 3D gaming space!<br><br>ROLE PLAY<br>In the game house, you can play a variety of roles! Become a doctor, a police officer, a makeup artist, a farmer, a fireman, or an ice cream maker! Experience the daily life of all professions in this virtual 3D game world. Create your own exciting story!<br><br>DRIVING SIMULATION<br>You can also drive your car to different cities for adventure. There are a total of 22 vehicles for you to choose from, including school buses, police cars, fire trucks and more. Explore a variety of thrilling scenes and perform fun but complex tasks. Enjoy car driving!<br><br>EDUCATIONAL MINI-GAMES<br>There are all kinds of educational games: maze, finding bunnies, fruit cutting, surfing at sea and more. Would you like to challenge them? It will not only test your reflexes, but also improve your logical thinking. Are you ready? Enter the game house and challenge now !<br><br>Baby Panda&#39;s Game House is full of fun! No matter what kind of 3D games you like, the game House can stimulate your infinite potential. Join us now and explore this fantastic game house!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>- A game house for children;<br>- 38 3D games that kids love;<br>- Play 17 roles in real life;<br>- Numerous thrilling scenes to explore;<br>- Multiple new games will be added;<br>- Kid-friendly: free to switch mini-games;<br>- Supports offline play!<br><br>About BabyBus<br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>At BabyBus, we dedicate ourselves to sparking kids&#39; creativity, imagination and curiosity,and designing our products through the kids&#39; perspective to help them explore the world on their own.<br><br>Now BabyBus offers a wide variety of products, videos and other educational content for over 600 million fans from ages 0-8 around the world! We have released over 200 children&#39;s apps, over 2500 episodes of nursery rhymes and animations, over 9000 stories  of various themes spanning the Health, Language, Society, Science, Art and other fields.<br><br>\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014<br>Contact us: ser@babybus.com<br>Visit us: http://www.babybus.com",
